1
00:00:00,602 --> 00:00:04,142
(Bernadette:)I can hook you up with anxiety
medication, antidepressants.

2
00:00:04,306 --> 00:00:05,716
(Penny:)Really.

3
00:00:06,708 --> 00:00:08,818
(Stuart:)Do you have any of these?

4
00:00:13,715 --> 00:00:16,125
(Amy:)Hello, Mr. Rat Brain.

5
00:00:17,319 --> 00:00:21,289
(Amy:)Not so bitey without the rest of the
rat to back us up now, are we?

6
00:00:21,557 --> 00:00:23,227
(Howard:)-Anybody home?

7
00:00:23,492 --> 00:00:24,702
(Amy:)Hey, what brings you guys here?

8
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:26,310
(Raj:)Well, we were just on our way
to lunch and wanted to see

9
00:00:26,461 --> 00:00:28,571
(Raj:)-if you'd like to join.
-Why?

10
00:00:28,730 --> 00:00:30,180
(Amy:)Because Sheldon's
not here this week,

11
00:00:30,332 --> 00:00:31,742
(Amy:)and you don't think I
have any other options?

12
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,570
(Amy:)I'm just kidding.
I'll get my purse.

13
00:00:34,069 --> 00:00:36,409
(Bert:)Hi, Amy. I... Oh.

14
00:00:36,572 --> 00:00:38,352
(Bert:)I'm sorry. I didn't know
you had any company.

15
00:00:38,507 --> 00:00:41,047
(Amy:)That's okay.
Bert, this is Howard and Rajesh.

16
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:42,250
(Amy:)Guys, this is Bert.

17
00:00:42,411 --> 00:00:43,411
(Raj:)-Hey. Good to see you.
-Hey.

18
00:00:43,579 --> 00:00:45,149
(Bert:)Anyway, I wanted to show you

19
00:00:45,314 --> 00:00:47,354
(Bert:)this tourmalinated quartz
that we got in the lab.

20
00:00:47,983 --> 00:00:49,253
(Amy:)This is so pretty.

21
00:00:49,418 --> 00:00:50,988
(Amy:)Bert works for the
geology department.

22
00:00:51,153 --> 00:00:54,933
Yeah. You know what geologists
and Bon Jovi have in common?

23
00:00:55,657 --> 00:00:59,027
(Howard:)You're both into rock?

